To run the program -->

make
./220101096


Here number is defined to exclude any number of form -4 or +110  type 
so any expr(1*-2)--> here ideally we are multiplying 1 with -2  , but in our case it would give syntax error

Also i have defined type of expression ,term, factor as double so expr(10/3)  would give result 3.333333


Here invalid binary digit or hexadecimal is also handled , for eg --> 
    bintodec(45)   -->Invalid Binary digit

    